dit is een file waar we bijhouden welke functies er al in routes staan en welke nog moeten toevegen: 

nog toe te voegen:






al in routes.py:

1.	inventory()
	Main inventory overview page
	Shows sidebar with brands/materials, filters, and reservations panel
	Handles filtering by type, description, brand, zone, lifecycle, purpose, and packaging

2. add_item() 
	Creates a new material/zone/item combination
	Handles form submission to add new inventory items
	Creates materials and zones if they don't exist

3. use_item(item_id)
	Creates a reservation for an existing item
	Allows users to reserve/use items from inventory
	Takes username, project, and quantity

4. update_quantity(item_id) 
	Updates quantity from inline form on inventory page
	Quick quantity update without full edit page

5. edit_material(material_id) 
	Edits material properties (brand, type, description, lifecycle, price)
	Full edit form for material information

6. edit_item(item_id) 
	Edits item properties (zone, purpose, packaging, comment)
	Full edit form for item information

7. delete_reservation() 
	Deletes a single reservation from the cart panel
	Removes reservations by item_id, username, and date
